<section id="Sx1.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">B. Error Analysis</h3>

<div id="Sx1.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Embedding models often struggle with numerical inconsistencies in semantically similar content. For example, when searching for "3 fairy tales", the model might give low similarity scores to content containing "5 fairy tales", even though the core content is relevant. This happens because embedding models treat numbers as regular tokens without understanding their quantitative relationship. Future improvements could include incorporating retrieval augmented generation to provide external numerical knowledge, and enriching training data with more numerical variations to enhance the model’s understanding of quantitative relationships.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
